                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="1. 铁轨" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="通过计量轨道之间的距离可以得出，Minecraft中的铁轨为轨距750mm的窄轨。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="2. 红石中继器" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="红石中继器的纹理是由若干个其他方块的纹理拼凑成的。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="3. 灯笼" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
